# SS2 and SS3 map the next printed character through G2 or G3, here DEC
# special graphics and, since ESC + < designates ASCII in UTF-8 input,
# ASCII. The next printed character takes the shift even when it is a
# space, and a control before it leaves the shift waiting.
# spec: the VT220 manual, 4.4.4; ctlseqs, SS2 and SS3
# covers: text.charsets
size 20 3
send "\e*0\e+<"
send "\eNqq\eOaa"
send "\eN \bq"
send "\eN\r\nq"
dump state
